# A small example map for Shaftcast.
#   #  wall (default brick texture)
#   .  empty floor
#   >  player spawn, facing east   (< west, v south, ^ north, @ east)
#
# Rows are padded with floor space automatically, so uneven rows are fine.
#
# Other characters (%, =, +, *, $, @ as a wall, P, ...) also become walls and
# get their own shading ramp, so maps can carry per-tile textures.
